# LF on every checkout, Windows included. Two things depend on it:
#  - `npm run check:frozen` hashes the contract files byte for byte; a CRLF
#    checkout (core.autocrlf=true, Git for Windows' default) fails the gate.
#  - the macOS launcher: a CRLF line makes bash fail with "$'\r': command not found".
* text=auto eol=lf
